OL,3,GNEWSAMan who drove 139mph before fatal
OL,4,Acrash jailed
OL,5,
OL,6,FA man who had been driving at almost
OL,7,F140mph before killing a passenger in a
OL,8,Fcrash has been jailed.
OL,10,FLuciano Spirito, who was 22 at the time
OL,11,Fof the crash in February 2023, had been
OL,12,Fdriving four passengers on the A20,
OL,13,Fnear Farningham in Kent, before
OL,14,Fcolliding with a van.
OL,16,FDarcy Thomsett, 19, died from a head
OL,17,Finjury while Sienna Smith, also 18,
OL,18,Fsuffered a traumatic brain injury and
OL,19,Fpelvic injuries.
OL,23,APub: 18-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBLon/SE NewsCReg TVFClean Feed
FL,322,320,200,140,0,100
